    "chunk_text": "& \u00feurh hine \u00dea se cyng sume \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re tide het on h\u00e6ftne\u00f0e gebringan.& sy\u00f0\u00f0an swi\u00f0e gemahlice ofer eall \u00feis And \u00feone eorl Rotbert het se cyng to Windlesoran l\u00e6dan.& \u00fe\u00e6r innan \u00feam castele healdan. Eac on \u00feis ylcan geare togeanes Eastron com \u00fe\u00e6s Papan sande hider to lande.\u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Waltear & he hine underfeng \u00e6t his arcestole on Cantwarabyrig.and se biscop Waltear her on lande \u00fe\u00e6s \u00d0ises ylcan eac geares w\u00e6ron swi\u00f0e untid gewidera.& for\u00fei geond eall \u00feis land wurdon On \u00feison geare heold se cyng Willelm his hired to Cristes m\u00e6ssan on Windlesoran. & Willelm biscop of Dunholme \u00fe\u00e6r for\u00f0ferde to geares d\u00e6ge. And on Octabris Epiphanis w\u00e6s se cyng & ealle his witan on Searbyrig. \u00de\u00e6r beteah Gosfrei Bainard Willelm of Ou \u00fees cynges m\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6t he heafde gebeon on \u00fees cynges & sy\u00f0\u00f0an he ofercumen w\u00e6s.him het se cyng \u00fea eagan utadon.& sy\u00fe\u00f0an belisnian. & his stiward Willelm hatte.se w\u00e6s his modrian sunu.het se cyng on rode ahon. \u00d0\u00e6r wear\u00f0 eac Eoda eorl of Campaine \u00fe\u00e6s cynges a\u00f0um & manege o\u00f0re belende.& sumne man \u00d0ises geares eac to \u00feam Eastran wear\u00f0 swi\u00f0e mycel styrung geond ealle \u00feas \u00feeode.",
